post.description:
Idempotently provision a tenant with default policy (Phase 22.1).

Creating the same tenant id twice returns the tenant (idempotent);
quota fields given here are applied on both calls.

SlaPolicyRequest.description:
Configure an SLA policy (backlog): tenant/priority/channel limits.

``tenant_id``/``priority``/``channel`` may be null to express defaults;
resolution falls back exact -> tenant -> global default.
